    "Exercise Minutes count time Apple Health classifies as brisk activity or workouts. The value can differ from workout duration because intensity, heart rate, and motion all matter. Use it to see whether your recent activity is consistently reaching meaningful effort." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exercise Minutes count time Apple Health classifies as brisk activity or workouts. The value can differ from workout duration because intensity, heart rate, and motion all matter. Use it to see whether your recent activity is consistently reaching meaningful effort."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锻炼分钟数统计被健康 App 判定为较高强度活动或运动的时间。该数值可能与训练时长不同，因为强度、心率和动作都会影响判定。可用它查看近期活动是否持续达到有效强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
