    "Time In Daylight estimates how long supported devices detected outdoor daylight exposure. Daylight can support circadian rhythm, mood, and sleep timing, but readings depend on device support and whether the device was worn." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time In Daylight estimates how long supported devices detected outdoor daylight exposure. Daylight can support circadian rhythm, mood, and sleep timing, but readings depend on device support and whether the device was worn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日照时间估算受支持设备检测到的户外日光暴露时长。日光有助于昼夜节律、情绪和睡眠时间安排，但读数取决于设备支持情况以及是否佩戴。"
          }
        }
      }
